# MenkyoNavi serves /ads.txt dynamically when a validated publisher ID is set:
#   ADSENSE_PUBLISHER_ID=pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX   (real numeric ID only)
#
# Live ad rendering is separate and remains off until:
#   ADSENSE_ENABLED=true
#   plus consent gates when ADSENSE_REQUIRE_CONSENT=true
#
# Example line format (do not use this placeholder ID in production):
# google.com, pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX, DIRECT, f08c47fec0942fa0
#
# Until a real publisher ID is configured, GET /ads.txt returns 404.
# Setting only the publisher ID does not load AdSense scripts.
